			"notes": "Minecraft 26.2 / Fabric release.\n\nChanges since 0.2.0:\n- per-server anti-datapack profiles and custom spacing, separation, frequency, and salts\n- automatic vanilla -> verified UltimateAntiSeedCracker fallback\n- structure-placement observations, analysis, and village proximity evidence\n- client-side structure, biome, and spawn-habitat locating\n- broader supported structure set, candidate validation fixes, tests, and documentation\n\nRequires Java 25, Fabric API, and SeedMapper 2.29.1 for exact biome/spawn-habitat locating. See README for commands and limitations."
